    {
      "id": "36106831-6d40-46c3-9a66-65bea0454cfb",
      "name": "Why MCP makes working with Umbraco a joy",
      "path": "WWW / Blog / Why MCP makes working with Umbraco a joy",
      "docTypeId": "d9d190bc-3a5a-419a-8fb7-36ac58614c44",
      "templateId": "c6d55402-230f-4cca-855f-d492ae289e95",
      "state": "Published",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "Why MCP makes working with Umbraco a joy"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.DateTime",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "publishDate",
          "value": "2026-10-01 09:00:00"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "excerpt",
          "value": "MCP lets an assistant read and change the site through the same named tools every time, so the repetitive work gets faster and safer."
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "listingImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "d412df18-af32-49a3-b7c2-46c4b2ee5521",
              "mediaKey": "ba04b4e9-4c7a-4580-adb1-375c8506d32c",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.BlockGrid",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "body",
          "value": {
            "layout": {
              "Umbraco.BlockGrid": [
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "8b55defd-2b59-4320-9fe4-1b37853bb27f",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "365c4d90-85b9-416f-bc3f-9b3ed1f1f4ae",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "b9622106-6974-4cb0-9fe5-1564b0dd8d30",
                  "settingsKey": null
                },
                {
                  "$type": "BlockGridLayoutItem",
                  "columnSpan": 12,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                  "areas": [],
                  "contentKey": "84cde015-1052-4993-a68a-9f67372454ec",
                  "settingsKey": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "contentData": [
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "d7912b9e-0a8f-428b-97e9-bfa6dec791d5",
                "key": "8b55defd-2b59-4320-9fe4-1b37853bb27f",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>The Model Context Protocol, or MCP, gives AI assistants a standard way to call tools. Instead of scraping screens or guessing at APIs, the assistant gets a named set of actions with clear inputs and outputs.</p><p>For Umbraco that means document types, data types, templates and content can be built through the same interface a careful developer would use.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "f1edb8a6-b05e-48ba-9e03-61a770f2db40",
                "key": "365c4d90-85b9-416f-bc3f-9b3ed1f1f4ae",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "image",
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "key": "97e46f59-0128-43ce-86b2-075b6cdb1288",
                        "mediaKey": "d469402f-3b95-495c-90c2-596ba50bffec",
                        "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
                        "crops": [],
                        "focalPoint": null
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "caption",
                    "value": "Photo by Chris Ried on Unsplash."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "d7912b9e-0a8f-428b-97e9-bfa6dec791d5",
                "key": "b9622106-6974-4cb0-9fe5-1564b0dd8d30",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "text",
                    "value": {
                      "markup": "<p>The biggest win is feedback. When a call fails, the error says what to fix, so the next attempt is a small correction rather than a guess. That keeps the work moving and keeps the project's rules intact.</p><p>Each change is read back after it is saved, so what you see is what was stored.</p>",
                      "blocks": {
                        "layout": {},
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "d674e487-b311-4ebf-ac5f-72f3214381bc",
                "key": "84cde015-1052-4993-a68a-9f67372454ec",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextArea",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "quote",
                    "value": "Good tools make the right thing the easy thing."
                  },
                  {
                    "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
                    "culture": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "alias": "attribution",
                    "value": "Umbraco.Bench build notes"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "settingsData": [],
            "expose": [
              {
                "contentKey": "8b55defd-2b59-4320-9fe4-1b37853bb27f",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              },
              {
                "contentKey": "365c4d90-85b9-416f-bc3f-9b3ed1f1f4ae",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              },
              {
                "contentKey": "b9622106-6974-4cb0-9fe5-1564b0dd8d30",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              },
              {
                "contentKey": "84cde015-1052-4993-a68a-9f67372454ec",
                "culture": null,
                "segment": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
